{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_035C60","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你是什么时候发现你父亲和KGB联手的？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"大约半年前。在那之前，我们只能吃豆子，后来突然开始有人送来鸡蛋和面粉，弹药也不再短缺了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"<R=毒品,COCAINE>是怎么弄到的？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=毒品,COCAINE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"去问KGB吧。我想我们在这里只负责精炼可卡因。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"这一带也能种古柯，但原料大多应该是从哥伦比亚和玻利维亚一带弄来的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"在工厂加工后，再运到加勒比海的港口。之后呢？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"我没想过……不，我是不愿去想。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"世界上最大的可卡因消费国是美国。大概会伪装成渔船之类运过去吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"等等。如果<R=CIA,LA CIA>也在利用那条路线，那<R=CIA,LA CIA>也在把毒品卖给美国？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=CIA,LA CIA>\", \"<R=CIA,LA CIA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":103,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"那就会是这样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"他们拼命走私毒品，就是为了让自己国家的年轻人变成瘾君子？为什么要干这种蠢事！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"他们害怕吧。尤其害怕中美洲出现共产主义国家。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""}]}